    {
      "name": "Services & migration",
      "text": "Services & migration\n\nA clear path from local deployment to your cloud environment.\n\nRefresh\nLocal storage and the search index are separate. Back up the stored originals, database, and encryption key before moving environments. A search index can be rebuilt; a lost original or encryption key cannot.\nLocal deployment\navailable\n\nNext.js frontend, Python API, durable local volumes, and configurable vector search.\n\nOpenAI models\nsetup required\n\nBring your own API key. Content is sent only with explicit external processing approval.\n\nOCI migration\nunverified\n\nStorage, model, and managed vector adapters are implemented. Live tenancy validation is still required before production use.\n\nMigration checklist\n\nValidate each layer before changing the active provider.\n\n1\nCreate a verified backup\n\nStop writes and back up the persistent data volume, originals, database, and encryption key. Test a restore in a separate environment.\n\n2\nProvision the destination\n\nConfirm OCI region, compartment permissions, Object Storage, model availability, and the supported vector-search service.\n\n3\nValidate the cloud adapters\n\nVerify authentication, storage reads and writes, retries, timeouts, vector dimensions, and model limits. Adapter tests do not substitute for a live tenancy round-trip.\n\n4\nCopy originals and metadata\n\nKeep document identifiers stable and compare object checksums. Never delete local originals before validating the destination.\n\n5\nRebuild and compare indexes\n\nReindex when the embedding provider, model, dimensions, or chunk strategy changes. Run known queries and inspect their evidence.\n\n6\nSwitch with a rollback plan\n\nRun a canary workload, compare answers and extraction results, then switch providers. Retain the tested backup and prior configuration.\n\nOperational boundaries\nStorage-first ingestion\n\nA failed embedding or indexing job leaves the original stored. Retry from Jobs & activity after fixing the provider.\n\nIndependent cloud billing\n\nOpenAI API and OCI service charges are billed by those providers. A ChatGPT plan does not include this application’s API usage.\n\nNo silent provider fallbacks\n\nUnavailable model and cloud adapters report a clear error. Mock mode must be selected explicitly for development tests.\n\nBackups and restore\n\nUse the repository deployment guide and backup scripts. Configuration export is sanitized and is not a complete data backup.\n\nExport sanitized settings\nLive readiness report\n{\n  \"reranker\": {\n    \"enabled\": false,\n    \"provider\": \"none\",\n    \"model\": null,\n    \"revision\": null,\n    \"candidate_limit\": null,\n    \"ready\": false\n  },\n  \"queue\": {\n    \"provider\": \"database\",\n    \"implemented\": true,\n    \"configured\": true,\n    \"ready\": true,\n    \"status\": \"local\",\n    \"live_verified\": false,\n    \"durable_source\": \"database\",\n    \"reconciliation_required\": true,\n    \"reason\": \"Database polling selected; no external queue required\"\n  },\n  \"local\": {\n    \"storage\": true,\n    \"qdrant\": true,\n    \"postgresql\": true,\n    \"openai_responses\": true,\n    \"sentence_transformers\": true,\n    \"ollama\": true,\n    \"ocr\": false,\n    \"streaming\": true\n  },\n  \"oci\": {\n    \"object_storage\": {\n      \"implemented\": true,\n      \"ready\": false,\n      \"status\": \"unverified\",\n      \"reason\": \"SDK adapter implemented; tenancy connectivity and round-t",
