      "name": "Setup",
      "text": "Setup\n\nGet your workspace ready, one deliberate step at a time.\n\nRefresh\nA considered start\n\nYour workspace is ready for storage. Configure intelligence when you need it.\n\nAdministrator signed in\n1\nAdministrator account\n\nSigned in as agent-qa-1791640245. Authentication uses an HttpOnly session cookie.\n\nAccount configured\n2\nConnect your providers\n\nChoose local embeddings or add your own OpenAI key. Keys stay encrypted on the server.\n\nConfigure connections\n3\nCreate a dataset\n\nName your dataset, map its chat, extraction, and embedding models, then upload PDF, DOCX, or TXT files.\n\nAdd documents\n4\nVerify your first answer\n\nApprove external processing, ask a focused question, and inspect the cited excerpts.\n\nDocument Chat\n5\nProtect your workspace\n\nReview the deployment and backup guide before making this service accessible to other users.\n\nReview operations\nBefore using an external provider, review what content is sent and who is billed. Aegis asks for approval for document processing, chat, and extraction. Always review generated answers against their original sources.",
